  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In the Open Beta, a new feature has been added allowing users to configure permissions for emojis, stickers, etc., individually per instance.\n\nWhile there may be varying opinions regarding the feature itself, this feedback specifically addresses the steps involved in configuring these settings.\n\nCurrently, creating a new instance requires opening configuration windows twice, which feels somewhat cumbersome and disrupts the workflow.\n\nIt would be greatly appreciated if you could consolidate the settings into a single window, as shown in the attached image. This would streamline the instance creation process significantly.\n\nThank you for your consideration.",
